  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Attempting to upload a Video Clip for use in a world fails. Specifically, all Video Clips utilized in a world seem to disappear upon upload, breaking the functionality they were meant to serve. Audio Clips do not share this problem, despite being functionally similar. As a result, Audio Clips are properly uploaded with the rest of the world's assets while Video Clips are not. Both the SDK and the SDK documentation refer to using Video Clips with various components, so this bug renders these aspects of the SDK unusable.",
